%N A068548 Coefficients of (-x^(2n-6)) in Chebyshev polynomial of degree 2n.
%H A068548 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A068548/b068548.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..1000</a>
%H A068548 <a href="/index/Rec#order_04">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (16,-96,256,-256).
%F A068548 a(n) = n*(2*n^2+3*n-2)/12*4^n. - _Ralf Stephan_, May 08 2004
%F A068548 G.f.: x*(1+16*x-16*x^2)/(4*x-1)^4. - _R. J. Mathar_, May 20 2013
%F A068548 E.g.f.: exp(4*x)*x*(3 + 36*x + 32*x^2)/3. - _Stefano Spezia_, Sep 27 2026
%t A068548 A068548[n_] := 4^(n - 1)*n*(n + 2)*(2*n - 1)/3; Array[A068548, 25] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Sep 29 2026 *)
%t A068548 (* Alternative: *)
%t A068548 LinearRecurrence[{16, -96, 256, -256}, {1, 32, 400, 3584}, 25] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Sep 29 2026 *)
